  "interpretation": {
    "primary": "No registered omnibus method passed all confirmatory criteria at window size 60. Energy distance, Gaussian MMD and Wasserstein-1 had higher mean shape AUC than the best targeted mean, but all failed the worst-case AUC >= 0.70 criterion. The shared bottleneck was the registered Student-t(df=5) to Gaussian lighter-tail transition; the best AUC in that cell was 0.59333725 for Gaussian MMD.",
